  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "PMat mathematical geometry",
    "overview": "PMat mathematical geometry is the inherited visual anchor: the ULM identity, maroon fields, Plus Jakarta Sans, and luminous white glass connect the public portal and internal workspace. The admin extension uses compact type, pale colored surfaces, and controlled shadows to keep operational content readable.\n\nThis record describes the shipped admin and reader extensions and their shared primitives. The public landing and catalog remain the visual authority for the established identity; this documentation does not declare those pages redesigned. Route composition and validation evidence live in the dashboard, flipbook, and chat launcher surface briefs. The reader carries the public maroon and glass into a quiet paper stage; search and cited answers support the document rather than competing with it. Tama extends the assistant identity with the user-pinned hornbill artwork, while its controls retain the existing maroon and pale glass materials.",
